    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"ko\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r40956678\">.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:auto}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-header,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-subheader,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-above,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-title,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-image,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data,body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .infobox-below{text-align:center}</style><table class=\"infobox\"><caption class=\"infobox-title\" style=\"background:MidnightBlue; color:#ffffff; text-align: center;\">보렐리 혜성</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Comet_Borrelly_Nucleus.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Comet_Borrelly_Nucleus.jpg/330px-Comet_Borrelly_Nucleus.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1.1\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/Comet_Borrelly_Nucleus.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"500\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background-color:MidnightBlue; color:#ffffff;\">발견</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EC%86%8C%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1%EC%B2%B4_%EB%B0%9C%EA%B2%AC%EC%9E%90_%EB%AA%A9%EB%A1%9D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"소행성체 발견자 목록 (문서가 존재하지 않음)\">발견자</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">알폰세 보렐리</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\">발견일</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/1904%EB%85%84\" title=\"1904년\">1904년</a> <a href=\"/wiki/12%EC%9B%94_28%EC%9D%BC\" title=\"12월 28일\">12월 28일</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background-color:MidnightBlue; color:#ffffff;\">명칭</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%B2%9C%EB%AC%B8%ED%95%99%EC%9D%98_%EC%9E%84%EC%8B%9C_%EB%AA%85%EC%B9%AD\" title=\"천문학의 임시 명칭\">대체 명칭</a></div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">1905 II; 1911 VIII; 1918 IV;<br /> 1925 VIII; 1932 IV; 1953 IV;<br /> 1960 V; 1967 VIII; 1974 VII;<br /> 1981 IV; 1987 XXXIII; 1994 XXX</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background-color:MidnightBlue; color:#ffffff;\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EC%A0%91%EC%B4%89_%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"접촉 궤도 (문서가 존재하지 않음)\">궤도 특성</a></th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9E%A5%EC%B6%95%EB%8B%A8\" title=\"장축단\">원일점</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">5.90 AU<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MPC&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MPC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9E%A5%EC%B6%95%EB%8B%A8\" title=\"장축단\">근일점</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">1.306 AU<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MPC&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MPC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B8%B4%EB%B0%98%EC%A7%80%EB%A6%84\" title=\"긴반지름\">긴반지름</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">3.61 AU</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84_%EC%9D%B4%EC%8B%AC%EB%A5%A0\" title=\"궤도 이심률\">이심률</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">0.6377</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%84_%EC%A3%BC%EA%B8%B0\" title=\"공전 주기\">공전 주기</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">6.85 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9C%A8%EB%A6%AC%EC%9A%B0%EC%8A%A4%EB%85%84\" title=\"율리우스년\">a</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84_%EA%B2%BD%EC%82%AC\" title=\"궤도 경사\">경사</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">29.30°</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\">마지막 근일점</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/2022%EB%85%84\" title=\"2022년\">2022년</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2%EC%9B%94_1%EC%9D%BC\" title=\"2월 1일\">2월 1일</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MPC&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MPC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\">다음 근일점</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028%EB%85%84\" title=\"2028년\">2028년</a> <a href=\"/wiki/12%EC%9B%94_11%EC%9D%BC\" title=\"12월 11일\">12월 11일</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Horizons2028&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Horizons2028-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\">지구 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%B5%9C%EC%86%8C_%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84_%EA%B5%90%EC%B0%A8_%EA%B1%B0%EB%A6%AC\" title=\"최소 궤도 교차 거리\">MOID</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">0.36 AU</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background-color:MidnightBlue; color:#ffffff;\"><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Infobox&#95;Physical&#95;characteristics\"></span> 물리적 특성</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">평균 반지름</div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">2.4 km<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EB%B6%80%ED%94%BC\" title=\"부피\">부피</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">8×4×4&#160;km<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Weaver2003&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Weaver2003-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%A7%88%EB%9F%89\" title=\"질량\">질량</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">2×10<span style=\"display:none\">^</span><sup>13</sup> <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Kilogram&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Kilogram (문서가 존재하지 않음)\">kg</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\">평균 <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%B0%80%EB%8F%84\" title=\"밀도\">밀도</a></div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">0.3 g/cm<sup>3</sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Britt2006&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Britt2006-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2em;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B8%B0%ED%95%98%ED%95%99%EC%A0%81_%EB%B0%98%EC%82%AC%EC%9C%A8\" title=\"기하학적 반사율\">기하학적 반사율</a></div></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">0.03<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-dark&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-dark-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:11px; float:right; margin:2px\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"style=&quot;font-size:\">\n<td colspan=\"8\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b>최근 역기점에서의<br />근일점 거리</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MPC&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MPC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%97%AD%EA%B8%B0%EC%A0%90\" title=\"역기점\">역기점</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B7%BC%EC%9D%BC%EC%A0%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"근일점\">근일점</a><br />(<a href=\"/wiki/%EC%B2%9C%EB%AC%B8%EB%8B%A8%EC%9C%84\" title=\"천문단위\">AU</a>)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2028</td>\n<td>1.310<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Horizons2028&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Horizons2028-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>1.306\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>1.349\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2008</td>\n<td>1.355\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>보렐리 혜성</b>(<b><span lang=\"en\">Comet Borrelly</span></b> <span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"IPA nopopups\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA_for_English\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Help:IPA for English\">/<span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"&#39;b&#39; in &#39;buy&#39;\">b</span><span title=\"/ɒ/: &#39;o&#39; in &#39;body&#39;\">ɒ</span><span title=\"/ˈ/: primary stress follows\">ˈ</span><span title=\"&#39;r&#39; in &#39;rye&#39;\">r</span><span title=\"/ɛ/: &#39;e&#39; in &#39;dress&#39;\">ɛ</span><span title=\"&#39;l&#39; in &#39;lie&#39;\">l</span><span title=\"/i/: &#39;y&#39; in &#39;happy&#39;\">i</span></span>/</a></span></span> 또는 <b><span lang=\"en\">Borrelly's Comet</span></b>)은 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%A3%BC%EA%B8%B0_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1\" title=\"주기 혜성\">주기 혜성</a>으로, 2001년 <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%94%A5_%EC%8A%A4%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4_1%ED%98%B8\" title=\"딥 스페이스 1호\">딥 스페이스 1호</a>가 방문하였다. 보렐리 혜성의 마지막 <a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B7%BC%EC%9D%BC%EC%A0%90\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"근일점\">근일점</a> 통과 시점은 <a href=\"/wiki/2022%EB%85%84\" title=\"2022년\">2022년</a> 2월 1일이었으며,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MPC&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MPC-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Yoshida&#95;8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Yoshida-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> 다음은 2028년 12월 11일에 접근할 예정이다.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Horizons2028&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Horizons2028-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>딥 스페이스 1호는 보렐리 혜성의 핵에서 3400 km 떨어진 지점에서 사진을 촬영했는데, 해상도는 한 화소당 45 m로, 당시까지 촬영한 혜성의 사진 중 가장 해상도가 높았었다.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"발견\"><span id=\".EB.B0.9C.EA.B2.AC\"></span>발견</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단 편집: 발견\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 발견\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>보렐리 혜성은 1904년 12월 28일, 알폰세 보렐리가 <a href=\"/wiki/%ED%94%84%EB%9E%91%EC%8A%A4\" title=\"프랑스\">프랑스</a> <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%A7%88%EB%A5%B4%EC%84%B8%EC%9C%A0\" title=\"마르세유\">마르세유</a>에서 혜성을 찾다가 발견하였다.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"딥_스페이스_1호\"><span id=\".EB.94.A5_.EC.8A.A4.ED.8E.98.EC.9D.B4.EC.8A.A4_1.ED.98.B8\"></span>딥 스페이스 1호</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단 편집: 딥 스페이스 1호\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 딥 스페이스 1호\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Animation_of_Deep_Space_1_trajectory.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Animation_of_Deep_Space_1_trajectory.gif/250px-Animation_of_Deep_Space_1_trajectory.gif?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Animation_of_Deep_Space_1_trajectory.gif/500px-Animation_of_Deep_Space_1_trajectory.gif?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"560\" data-file-height=\"420\" /></a><figcaption>1998년 10월 24일부터 2003년 12월 31일까지 딥 스페이스 1호의 궤적을 나타낸 그림.<br /><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r34311110\">.mw-parser-output .legend{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .legend-color{display:inline-block;min-width:1.25em;height:1.25em;line-height:1.25;margin:1px 0;text-align:center;border:1px solid black;background-color:transparent;color:black}.mw-parser-output .legend-text{}</style><span class=\"legend nowrap\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:magenta; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;딥 스페이스 1호</span>&#160;<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#183;</span>&#32;<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r34311110\" /><span class=\"legend nowrap\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:lime; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/9969_%EB%B8%8C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9C%A0\" title=\"9969 브라유\">9969 브라유</a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#183;</span>&#32;<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r34311110\" /><span class=\"legend nowrap\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:royalblue; color:white;\">&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%EC%A7%80%EA%B5%AC\" title=\"지구\">지구</a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#183;</span>&#32;<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r34311110\" /><span class=\"legend nowrap\"><span class=\"legend-color mw-no-invert\" style=\"background-color:Cyan; color:black;\">&#160;</span>&#160;보렐리 혜성</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p>2001년 9월 21일, <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%94%A5_%EC%8A%A4%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4_1%ED%98%B8\" title=\"딥 스페이스 1호\">딥 스페이스 1호</a>가 보렐리 혜성의 옆을 지나쳐갔다. 딥 스페이스 1호는 원래 기기 실험선이었지만, 연장 임무 도중 혜성으로 향했으며, 이를 통해 과학계에 계획하지 않았던 성과를 가져다주었다. 딥 스페이스 1호에 있던 자세 제어 장비가 고장났었음에도 불구하고, 지구로 혜성의 사진을 전송해 왔다.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Orbits_of_periodic_comets.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Orbits_of_periodic_comets.svg/langko-250px-Orbits_of_periodic_comets.svg.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Orbits_of_periodic_comets.svg/langko-500px-Orbits_of_periodic_comets.svg.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%95%BC%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1\" title=\"핼리 혜성\">핼리 혜성</a>, 보렐리 혜성, <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9D%B4%EC%BC%80%EC%95%BC-%EC%9E%A5_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1\" title=\"이케야-장 혜성\">이케야-장 혜성</a>의 궤도를 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%99%B8%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"외행성\">외행성</a>의 궤도와 같이 표시한 그림.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"각주\"><span id=\".EA.B0.81.EC.A3.BC\"></span>각주</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"문단 편집: 각주\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC_%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 각주\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r35556958\">.mw-parser-output .r