n class=\"reference-accessdate\">. 2014년 8월 8일에 확인함</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=19P%2FBorrelly%3A+Facts+%26+Figures&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fsolarsystem.nasa.gov%2Fplanets%2Fprofile.cfm%3FObject%3DCom&#95;19PBorrelly%26Display%3DFacts%26System%3DMetric&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fko.wikipedia.org%3A%EB%B3%B4%EB%A0%90%EB%A6%AC+%ED%98%9C%EC%84%B1\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Weaver2003-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Weaver2003_4-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation journal\">Weaver, H. A.; Stern, S.A.; Parker, J. Wm. (2003). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/sim_astronomical-journal_2003-07_126_1/page/444\">&#8220;Hubble Space Telescope STIS Observations of Comet 19P/BORRELLY during the Deep Space 1 Encounter&#8221;</a>. &#12298;The Astronomical Journal&#12299; (The American Astronomical Society) <b>126</b> (1): 444–451. <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%B9%84%EB%B8%8C%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\" title=\"비브코드\">Bibcode</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2003AJ....126..444W\">2003AJ....126..444W</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%94%94%EC%A7%80%ED%84%B8_%EA%B0%9D%EC%B2%B4_%EC%8B%9D%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90\" title=\"디지털 객체 식별자\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//dx.doi.org/10.1086%2F375752\" href=\"https://dx.doi.org/10.1086%2F375752\">10.1086/375752</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Astronomical+Journal&amp;rft.atitle=Hubble+Space+Telescope+STIS+Observations+of+Comet+19P%2FBORRELLY+during+the+Deep+Space+1+Encounter&amp;rft.volume=126&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=444-451&amp;rft.date=2003&amp;rft